title: $:/plugins/rimir/namespace/settings
caption: settings

\whitespace trim

! Namespace — settings & diagnostics

!! Scope

Restrict namespace behavior to tiddlers whose title starts with one of a
configured set of prefixes. Outside those prefixes, `[[ref]]` renders as a
plain TW link — references into namespace areas from there must be fully
qualified by design. Default is //Global// (every tiddler subject to namespace
behavior — same as before this setting existed).

<$radio tiddler="$:/config/rimir/namespace/scope-mode" value="global"> ''Global'' — apply namespace behavior to all tiddlers</$radio>

<$radio tiddler="$:/config/rimir/namespace/scope-mode" value="prefixes"> ''Restricted'' — only the prefixes listed below</$radio>

<$reveal type="match" state="$:/config/rimir/namespace/scope-mode" text="prefixes">
One prefix per line. The match is segment-boundary literal: prefix
`knowledge` covers exactly `knowledge` and `knowledge/...`, but NOT
`knowledgeBase/...`. Whitespace and blank lines are tolerated.

<$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/rimir/namespace/scope-prefixes" tag="textarea" rows="4" placeholder="add your prefixes here, one per line"/>
</$reveal>

---

!! Feature flags

Each feature is off by default. Toggle to enable.

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/rimir/namespace/walk-up" field="text" checked="yes" unchecked="no" default="no"> ''Walk-up'' — resolve bare refs by climbing the source tiddler's path segments</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/rimir/namespace/implicit-context" field="text" checked="yes" unchecked="no" default="no"> ''Implicit context'' — derive context from the `context` field on tiddlers</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/rimir/namespace/pseudo-expansion" field="text" checked="yes" unchecked="no" default="no"> ''Pseudo expansion'' — enable `_latest` and other pseudo-segment modules</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/rimir/namespace/aliases" field="text" checked="yes" unchecked="no" default="no"> ''Aliases'' — enable exact and pattern alias resolution</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/rimir/namespace/self-prefix" field="text" checked="yes" unchecked="no" default="no"> ''Self-prefix'' — resolve descendant refs by prepending the source title (`<source>/<ref>`)</$checkbox>

<$checkbox tiddler="$:/config/rimir/namespace/field-aliases" field="text" checked="yes" unchecked="no" default="no"> ''Field aliases'' — resolve refs against target-attached alias tokens declared in the configured field on each target tiddler</$checkbox>

